SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 17:17:03 and reappears at 18:25:56 IST\, se
 en from Kolhapur.\nThe Moon is 41° up in the SW · daylight\, Sun +18°.\
 nTimes against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moo
 n's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Kolhapur
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Kolhapur
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
